{"id":"n82929-1-4","stage":5,"title":"투덜거리다 · 嘟嘟嚷嚷","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n82929-1-4-1","ko":"당신, 내가 만든 음식이 맛없다고 투덜거릴 거면 먹지 마세요.","zh":"如果你觉得我做的饭难吃还要抱怨的话，那就别吃了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"당신,","meaning":"你","explanation":"당신：你","readings":[{"term":"당신","audio":"/audio/348eb0b3d01dfc542003.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30200","senseId":"3","lemma":"당신","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"당신","audio":"/audio/348eb0b3d01dfc542003.mp3"}},{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내가","audio":"/audio/7ee3e480d2ca3192b2bc.mp3"}},{"text":"만든","meaning":"制作，做，制造","explanation":"만들다：制作，做，制造；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"만들다","audio":"/audio/3c159cf2a6420ca9bda5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60317","senseId":"1","lemma":"만들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만든","audio":"/audio/ff3d22622fd1cccc3625.mp3"}},{"text":"음식이","meaning":"饮食，饭菜","explanation":"음식：饮食，饭菜；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"음식","audio":"/audio/2e144916046c2a6fc7df.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71114","senseId":"1","lemma":"음식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"음식이","audio":"/audio/ac731cf2b0de55e3e0d9.mp3"}},{"text":"맛없다고","meaning":"不好吃，没味道，无味","explanation":"맛없다：不好吃，没味道，无味；다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。","readings":[{"term":"맛없다","audio":"/audio/039760c04c09d00a70e6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29721","senseId":"1","lemma":"맛없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맛없다고","audio":"/audio/4316035361b25e2c18df.mp3"}},{"text":"투덜거릴","meaning":"嘟嘟嚷嚷，嘀嘀咕咕","explanation":"투덜거리다：嘟嘟嚷嚷，嘀嘀咕咕；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"투덜거리다","audio":"/audio/1529359ccbd084041a04.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82929","senseId":"1","lemma":"투덜거리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"투덜거릴","audio":"/audio/0bd28e17003c8542d840.mp3"}},{"text":"거면","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거면","audio":"/audio/aefead97b894ad2fb4e2.mp3"}},{"text":"먹지","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹지","audio":"/audio/459814465f88e153b13c.mp3"}},{"text":"마세요.","meaning":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","explanation":"말다：不要做、停止做（-지 말다）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72580","senseId":"1","lemma":"말다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마세요","audio":"/audio/0a355a328a450c9b0583.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"348eb0b3d01dfc54","term":"당신","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/348eb0b3d01dfc542003.mp3","entryId":"30200","definition":"(贬称)指代听话人。","pronunciation":["당신"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"3c159cf2a6420ca9","term":"만들다","zh":"制作，做，制造","audio":"/audio/3c159cf2a6420ca9bda5.mp3","entryId":"60317","definition":"使用气力或技术而使没有的东西生成。","pronunciation":["만들다"]},{"id":"2e144916046c2a6f","term":"음식","zh":"饮食，饭菜","audio":"/audio/2e144916046c2a6fc7df.mp3","entryId":"71114","definition":"饭、汤等人们每顿食用的东西。","pronunciation":["음ː식"]},{"id":"039760c04c09d00a","term":"맛없다","zh":"不好吃，没味道，无味","audio":"/audio/039760c04c09d00a70e6.mp3","entryId":"29721","definition":"食物的味道不好。","pronunciation":["마덥따"]},{"id":"1529359ccbd08404","term":"투덜거리다","zh":"嘟嘟嚷嚷，嘀嘀咕咕","audio":"/audio/1529359ccbd084041a04.mp3","entryId":"82929","definition":"用别人难以听清的低声一直发牢骚。","pronunciation":["투덜거리다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"f8b54c8d9bfb2043","term":"말다","zh":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3","entryId":"72580","definition":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","pronunciation":["말ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/252ab4da09bcfd5f6737.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n82929-1-4-2","ko":"알았어. 조용히 먹을게.","zh":"知道了，我会安静地吃的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"알았어.","meaning":"懂，明白","explanation":"알다：懂，明白；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"9","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"알았어","audio":"/audio/dede206a3da7cc7d567c.mp3"}},{"text":"조용히","meaning":"安静地","explanation":"조용히：安静地","readings":[{"term":"조용히","audio":"/audio/ae038c58a11863122784.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75797","senseId":"1","lemma":"조용히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"조용히","audio":"/audio/ae038c58a11863122784.mp3"}},{"text":"먹을게.","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；을게：向对方表达说话人的决定或承诺，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹을게","audio":"/audio/1e3bd726aa98aee019dd.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"懂，明白","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definitio